mages_w1/`**: Nuclei channel (DAPI/Hoechst)\n  * 📁 **`raw_images_w2/`**: Lysosomes channel (LysoTracker/LAMP1)\n  * 📁 **`raw_images_w3/`**: Cytoplasm/Whole Cell channel\n  * 📁 **`cell_masks/`**: Instance cell segmentation masks (generated by Cellpose)\n  * 📁 **`lysosome_masks/`**: Hand-curated 16-bit instance segmentation masks for lysosomes (Fiji curated)\n\n\nThis dataset currently contains the first 12 curated image sets from the 25-image curation batch.\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    136\nNumber of rows: 60 Total file size: 504 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨102⟩ Privacy⟨103⟩ About⟨104⟩ Careers⟨105⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
